		<p>Make this adjustment before you start driving and while the day/night lever is in the day position.</p>
		<p>Pull the day/night lever toward you to reduce the glare from the headlights of the vehicles behind you during night driving.</p>
		<p>Remember that you lose some rearview clarity in the night position.</p>
